{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RTS where you are tasked to investigate sightings of mysterious creatures and battle against hostile forces! Based on the classic Command &amp; Conquer series, the game will feel very familiar, but plays a lot different than your average strategy games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core mechanics are very simple! You can build units and buildings and you can give them orders. Your job is to keep them alive as long as possible!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't expect to stay in the game for too long, you have to be quick and manage your troops to avoid losing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natively supports the SteamDeck! Other controllers are not fully supported yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Protect your base at all costs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enemy players will constantly try to control the map and remove you from it. Be vigilant and never leave your base undefended!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Watch out for the supernatural!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are the\u00a0first responder\u00a0to handle supernatural\u00a0events, so don't be surprised when something new appears and be wary, they are usually out to get you!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find artifacts to help you survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/34cc0fe30af556f21c2ab99f54c18be2.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/34cc0fe30af556f21c2ab99f54c18be2.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/34cc0fe30af556f21c2ab99f54c18be2.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Artifacts are collectibles that will give you passive effects. They are the key to your survival in the long run!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small indie RTS game, and our first released project. I hope it gives you a couple hours of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Art made by: </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aleksandr Makarov: iknowkingrabbit.itch.io, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Csizmadia B\u00e1lint: majom48.itch.io,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>my sister</i><br><br><br><br><i>Music made by: </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>alkakrab: alkakrab.itch.io</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"S***! The ground is shaking!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967040/9150a5053c3cef28eeea5378fd9bf392858ed271.jpg"},{"name":"Need some help?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967040/4f0ac0b97b3efbc051b677fb997611f3fce0da22.jpg"},{"name":"Is it too easy?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967040/d8f150ad6ce0cf61ae2a78b0f07c9f61f395f853.jpg"},{"name":"I can see them from here!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967040/034a956e99a0d2ff1ef29b076142ec92974bce20.jpg"},{"name":"You can have my artifacts.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967040/c2ac446acf85f9cca589355224027363465e98e3.jpg"},{"name":"I'm not afraid of the dark.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967040/a6f268b14edf1bbc61024769282fa0d5c6fb9686.jpg"},{"name":"I'm getting the hang of this.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967040/6610b984be7a068d66669ce8d746ba16f41adb48.jpg"},{"name":"New horizons.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967040/8c4338a024140b38a1445ffa587251a1f8cf9b12.jpg"},{"name":"Smooth Sailing.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967040/0968835776a8dfca1a3c0f1c0cec336e80a7be25.jpg"},{"name":"Impressive!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967040/85da6e163b4356c7e41439886e684dcdcdd1a8fa.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967040?t=1764877212","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967040?t=1764877212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/bcdba9fc35e219e6c6620a06818eba82a6843f8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764877212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/bcdba9fc35e219e6c6620a06818eba82a6843f8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764877212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game has mild pixelated gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RTS where you are tasked to investigate sightings of mysterious creatures and battle against hostile forces! Based on the classic Command &amp; Conquer series, the game will feel very familiar, but plays a lot different than your average strategy games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core mechanics are very simple! You can build units and buildings and you can give them orders. Your job is to keep them alive as long as possible!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't expect to stay in the game for too long, you have to be quick and manage your troops to avoid losing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natively supports the SteamDeck! Other controllers are not fully supported yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Protect your base at all costs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enemy players will constantly try to control the map and remove you from it. Be vigilant and never leave your base undefended!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Watch out for the supernatural!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are the\u00a0first responder\u00a0to handle supernatural\u00a0events, so don't be surprised when something new appears and be wary, they are usually out to get you!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find artifacts to help you survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli